                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Reaction: You declared the &apos;Wrath of Brodd&apos; ability for a friendly unit</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit can use the &apos;Wrath of Brodd&apos; ability immediately after the &apos;Wrath of Brodd&apos; ability used by the other friendly unit has been resolved. This unit can do so even if it has used another **^^Destructive Impulse^^** ability this turn.</characteristic>
